          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SoF > PoA</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=108','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Mckenna Stormangel</font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 3/18/2002 1:45:28 AM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>SoF decided it was finally time to wrestle the Spiroc Lord for those sought after wingblades.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Lucane and Sanadan had a mission. To get SoF to the Spiroc Isle. Put those two working together and all hell breaks loose.<br><br>Once we got up there, things went fairly smooth barring a few link deaths and one persons overwhelming urge to skydive. =) With Sanadan at the helm and Bhhaal's flawless pulling, everything seemed pretty easy. <br><br>Once we got to the Spiroc Isle things started to get interesting. We went from 24 to 18 adventurer's for one reason or another and after scoping out the island for a while we decided not to wait any longer to start pulling.<br><br>Our first pull brought 10 out of the 15 mobs on the island, including the Guardian. Rayder did a great job of tanking him long enough to let us wipe out 2 Vanquisher's and 7 of their friends. We regrouped a bit and finished off the last Vanquisher and the other 3 mobs. All that was left was the Guardian and the Spiroc Lord. I volunteered to put my name in lights and took the DT while Daishan pulled the Lord to camp. Unfortunately the Guardian got agro and Odom had to keep him entertained while we took out the Lord. Then Siran the Lunatic decided to assist the Guardian and wiped all of us out except for Nos. Thankyou Odom and Nosfentaru. Nos' necro saved the day when he was able to rez in Lucane to loot the wingblade. GRATS LUCANE!!!!<br><br>We learned from that first Lord battle and decided to move camp a bit to avoid the Guardian agro. Doylee took the second DT and once again Daishan pulled the Spiroc Lord to his death and as our luck would have it, we received a second wingblade. GRATS RAYDER!!!<br><br>We received other lewts on the way, but once again I dropped the ball and forgot to make a list, teehee. Here's a bit of what I can remember.<br><br>Grats to:<br><br>Gooniee on his Symbol of Marr.<br><br>Sujin on his Warrior Haste Belt.<br><br>Daishan on his Belt of Tranquil and Whitened Treant Fists<br><br>Haletma on his Weight of Gods.<br><br>All in all we received 12 epic drops, including SK, Necro and Ranger. Grats Kirrov and Rathrax!!<br><br>I KNOW I missed other lewts that were awarded or rotted along with many quest pieces we received.<br><br>Once it was all over Lucane turned in all his epic pieces and is now the proud owner of his Warrior epics!! WOOT!! A first for SoF!!<br><br>Just two more pieces left for Rayder to be wielding his epics too.<br><br>An AWSOME day for SoF!!!<br><br>/salute<br><br><br><br>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          